<title>VENEZUELA: CANTV 9-mo Sept 30 share falls.</title>
<headline>CANTV 9-mo Sept 30 share falls.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earnings per share 104.1 bolivars vs 154.1 bolivars</p>
<p>Net profit 104.1 bln bolivars vs 154.1 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Total revenues 450 bln bolivars vs 455.0 bln</p>
<p>Operational costs 368.6 bln bolivars vs 404.6 bln</p>
<p>Monetary gain 26.5 bln bolivars vs 110.0 bln bolivars</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are consolidated, but not audited. All figures are expressed in constant September 30, 1996 bolivars.</p>
<p>Compania Anonima Nacional Telefonos de Venezuela (CANTV) is Venezuela's largest telephone company.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
